---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "David Frost — Software Engineer";
const description = "Software engineer working on cloud infrastructure at Capital One.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <main>
    <h1>David Frost</h1>
    <p>{description}</p>

    <h2>Now</h2>
    <p>
      I'm building <a href="https://retrofolio.dhfrost.com">Retrofolio</a>, a portfolio backtester I started because I wanted to know what would have happened if I'd actually held the things I almost bought. At Capital One I work on the network infrastructure behind the web and mobile apps, mostly cloud engineering, infrastructure-as-code, and CI/CD.
    </p>

    <h2>Projects</h2>

    <p>
      <a href="https://retrofolio.dhfrost.com">Retrofolio</a> — A portfolio backtester built with Next.js and FastAPI. Long-running backtests run through an async task pipeline so the UI stays responsive. Started it because every investing decision comes with a nagging "what if I'd just held it" question.
    </p>

    <p>
      Smart Lamp — IoT lighting system built with Raspberry Pi, MQTT, and Bluetooth for real-time control. Backed by a Django web dashboard with WebSockets and a native iOS app in Swift, with Ansible handling provisioning. Built four full-stack interfaces around a single physical device for a distributed systems course.
    </p>

    <footer>
      <a href="https://github.com/davidhfrost">GitHub</a>
      {" · "}
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/davidhfrost">LinkedIn</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>
